    "title": "TDEC begins talks on proposed nuclear waste storage campus in Rhea County - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Lily Butler ,\n9 hours ago RHEA COUNTY, Tenn. — Rhea County residents are getting their first look at what it could mean for the area to house part of a proposed Nuclear Life-cycle Innovation Campus, including the possibility of long-term storage of radioactive waste — an idea that has already sparked sharp pushback from some in the community. Read full article\n1",
